cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this proof or its verification code, please cite this work."
title: "The exact covering number C(70,21,2) is 15"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Valiyaparampil
    given-names: Troy
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 proof that fourteen blocks cannot cover all pairs of a 70-point set
  with blocks of size 21, accompanied by verifiers for an existing 15-block
  certificate. The paper credits Troy Valiyaparampil and GPT-6.2 Astra.
  GPT-6.2 Astra developed the argument and drafted the paper in OpenAI Codex.
  GPT-6.2 Sol sessions contributed review, certificate checks and Lean modules.
keywords:
  - covering designs
  - Lean 4
  - fractional matchings
